# SPA fallback. Every unsubscribe URL is /<token>, which is not a real file, so
# Cloudflare Pages must serve index.html for it and let the app read the token
# off location.pathname.
#
# Note this only covers GET/HEAD. The RFC 8058 one-click POST deliberately does
# NOT come here — Pages answers 405 to a POST for a static asset — it goes
# straight to the `unsubscribe` edge function. See docs/unsubscribe-cloudflare-setup.md.
